error[E0518]: accessors require a field, but 'size' is a function
 --> $DIR/interface-member.nra:5:9
  |
4 |     let size = func -> int;
  |         ---- 'size' is declared here
5 |         | get: 0;
  |         ^^^^^^^^^ accessor clause on a function
  |
  = note: a '|' clause after a member is an accessor clause of that member; class hooks are written after the class's '(', before its first member
  = help: remove the clause; only an exported instance field can have 'get' and 'set' accessors

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0518`.
